urXv9KWAxUgoK8BHbceFkAQ3IcHCJkBKAs",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_WAIT_TIME"],"候位時間多久？",[[[["E:DINING_WAIT_TIME_UP_TO_10_MIN"],"最多 10 分鐘",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwj5wurXv9KWAxUgoK8BHbceFkAQ3YcHCJwBKAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwj5wurXv9KWAxUgoK8BHbceFkAQ3IcHCJsBKAw",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["是好吃的拉麵！\n這次點了豚骨拉麵跟蛤蜊雞白湯拉麵（看到剩下三碗，就被吸引過去了）\n先用點餐機付費點餐後等待店員帶位，這間店肯定要大大加分的就是座位間距非常舒服，可以讓人吃得很自在。\n麵條部分是細麵，不過可以免費加半球或一球，直接跟店員告知即可，店員注意到麵是點軟的，也會直接把加麵註記是軟的，這點很用心。\n豚骨拉麵的湯頭溫潤厚實，蛤蠣雞白湯則有著明顯的鮮味，湯頭真的是好喝。加麵一球會另外給，給的麵量感覺比原本碗裡的量還要多，所以份量絕對不用擔心。\n看到在場很多客人都有點叉燒飯，下次可以嘗試，不過吃習慣比較清淡的，湯頭對於腸胃還是油膩了些，吃清淡的人可能要再評估一下。",null,[0,90]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10981822041176926576/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMmt3ZDFaVmFIcGhXR2hSV2xWS2VVeFZSazFqV0dSUFYwaHdlR05WUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10981822041176926576/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMmt3ZDFaVmFIcGhXR2hSV2xWS2VVeFZSazFqV0dSUFYwaHdlR05WUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/10981822041176926576/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMmt3ZDFaVmFIcGhXR2hSV2xWS2VVeFZSazFqV0dSUFYwaHdlR05WUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10981822041176926576/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMmt3ZDFaVmFIcGhXR2hSV2xWS2VVeFZSazFqV0dSUFYwaHdlR05WUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10981822041176926576/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMmt3ZDFaVmFIcGhXR2hSV2xWS2VVeFZSazFqV0dSUFYwaHdlR05WUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10981822041176926576/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMmt3ZDFaVmFIcGhXR2hSV2xWS2VVeFZSazFqV0dSUFYwaHdlR05WUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,13926,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kwd1ZVaHphWGhRWlVKeUxVRk1