FIND"],"停車位有點難找",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwj5wurXv9KWAxUgoK8BHbceFkAQ3YcHCPsBKAA"]],1],null,null,"停車位",null,"0ahUKEwj5wurXv9KWAxUgoK8BHbceFkAQ3IcHCPoBKAs",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_TIPS_TOPICS"],"可以針對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:PARKING"],"停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwj5wurXv9KWAxUgoK8BHbceFkAQ3YcHCP0BKAA"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwj5wurXv9KWAxUgoK8BHbceFkAQ3IcHCPwBKAw",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["第一次吃，是間中規中矩的拉麵店。\n有幾分餐點是屬於限量的，我們這次有點限量的海老雞白湯拉麵（chicken shrimp ramen)，湯頭是蝦頭炒鍋而孕育出的味道，挺香甜。\n另外就是，味玉雞白湯拉麵（chicken ramen with egg)，就是豚骨湯麵🍜。\n唐揚雞，雞肉juicy，蠻推的。\n拉麵一開始吃都很爽，但吃到後面還是覺得很鹹，對拉麵很挑的可以考慮考慮，但不雷就是了。\n\n點餐方式：自助式\n入座方式：屬於人數到齊，點完餐，服務員才會帶位。\n用餐時間：大部分人吃完就離席，很少坐著閒聊。",null,[0,133]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10981822041176926576/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFHVkZOc1ZuaFdNVGw1VmpKb1ZGSnVZM2RWU0ZwWVRWVXdkMW96WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10981822041176926576/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFHVkZOc1ZuaFdNVGw1VmpKb1ZGSnVZM2RWU0ZwWVRWVXdkMW96WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/10981822041176926576/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFHVkZOc1ZuaFdNVGw1VmpKb1ZGSnVZM2RWU0ZwWVRWVXdkMW96WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10981822041176926576/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFHVkZOc1ZuaFdNVGw1VmpKb1ZGSnVZM2RWU0ZwWVRWVXdkMW96WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10981822041176926576/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFHVkZOc1ZuaFdNVGw1VmpKb1ZGSnVZM2RWU0ZwWVRWVXdkMW96WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10981822041176926576/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFHVkZOc1ZuaFdNVGw1VmpKb1ZGSnVZM2RWU0ZwWVRWVXdkMW96WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,7643,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m